t state conflicts\n- `ShipmentController.kt` — Added `confirm()` method handling CREATED→CONFIRMED transition with idempotency and error cases\n- `ShipmentControllerTest.kt` — Added four test methods covering happy path, idempotency, cancelled rejection, and not-found rejection\n\n**Tests:**\n- `confirms_a_created_shipment_to_confirmed_status` — Verifies CREATED shipments transition to CONFIRMED\n- `confirms_an_already_confirmed_shipment_idempotently` — Verifies retry on CONFIRMED shipment succeeds without error\n- `rejects_confirming_a_cancelled_shipment_with_conflict_error` — Verifies HTTP 409 with SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATUS error code for CANCELLED shipments\n- `rejects_confirming_a_nonexistent_shipment_with_not_found_error` — Verifies HTTP 404 with SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND error code for missing shipment IDs\n\n**Verification:** Ran `./mvnw test` from `sample-service/` — Result: BUILD SUCCESS, 17 tests run, 0 failures, 0 errors (9 ShipmentControllerTest tests including 4 new)\n\n**Not done:** Nothing. All acceptance criteria implemented, all tests pass, no forbidden files changed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5087,"cache_read_input_tokens":23367,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5087},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ac8537a8-32a5-470f-8af8-75b8ddf05c94","uuid":"2ba59fba-abbe-4e6e-b61c-187806aac5e4","timestamp":"2026-09-15T17:30:54.742Z","request_id":"req_011Cf5d4FJdufXHXoC3f8RGh"}
